{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:39581969\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究聚焦DLPFC非侵入性刺激对PD双任务表现的影响，未测量FOG或STN神经活动，认知双任务改善不足以直接回答STN-FOG关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:39584859\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究综述前庭刺激对PD平衡和步态的影响，但未提供FOG特异性证据或STN相关神经机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:39587184\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接比较PD-FOG与非FOG患者对情绪性听觉刺激的步态启动反应，揭示边缘系统及注意资源竞争这一可与STN机制竞争的FOG发生机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:39591229\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"虽然直接综述FOG治疗效果，但重点是肉毒毒素的临床疗效，未涉及STN神经活动或能够解释STN-FOG关系的中枢机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:39592219\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"通过动物示踪揭示听觉皮层-基底节-GPe及其向楔形核和PAG的投射，为听觉触发FOG提供了可检验的非STN感觉-脑干网络机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:39592731\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述主要讨论蓝斑去甲肾上腺素系统退变与PD运动皮层功能障碍，缺乏FOG特异性证据及STN-FOG机制联系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:39593523\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接分析PD患者FOG的临床预测因素，发现疾病严重程度、病程及焦虑与FOG相关，可用于识别STN-FOG研究中的临床混杂因素和患者异质性。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:39606564\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"虽然研究检测了灵长类STN中的昼夜节律蛋白，但没有PD模型、FOG表型或神经活动数据，不能建立STN与FOG的联系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:39613480\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究关注早期PD数字生物标志物及疾病进展监测，未提供FOG特异性结果或STN神经生理证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:39621239\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究关注丘脑腹前核组胺调节及PD动物模型的一般运动改善，没有涉及STN活动或FOG。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:39622644\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究探讨小鼠纹状体striosome对多巴胺释放和一般运动的调节，但未涉及PD相关FOG或STN神经活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:39627032\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"虽然提供PD动物模型中皮质-纹状体高β振荡的机制证据，但未研究FOG或STN，不能确定这些振荡与冻结步态的关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:39627827\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究聚焦PD小鼠纹状体乙酰胆碱与多巴胺相互调节及一般运动行为，没有FOG表型或STN相关证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:39630386\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述主要讨论PD性别差异及一般运动和非运动症状，未提供FOG特异性机制或STN相关证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:39635977\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究讨论PD患者自行车轮椅这一移动辅助工具，与STN神经活动及FOG发生机制没有实质联系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:39640985\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究评估触觉提示对PD双任务步行表现的影响，但没有FOG特异性结局或STN神经活动证据，不能直接解释STN-FOG关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:39644495\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"该文是PD灵长类模型D1-MSN化学遗传学激活的实验方案，未提供FOG数据或STN相关机制证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:39659276\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究评估经颅及经脊髓磁刺激对PD轴性症状的影响，虽然测量了FOG问卷，但摘要未报告FOG特异性结果，也未涉及STN。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:39666124\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接调查PD患者DBS治疗FOG时的编程策略，发现专家在调整刺激幅度和频率方面存在明显分歧，可解释不同DBS研究中FOG疗效及刺激参数结果的异质性。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:39673940\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究提供辅助运动皮层在PD不同运动亚型中的结构差异证据，且该区域与FOG相关，可用于分析皮层网络病理及临床亚型异质性对STN-FOG关系的影响。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:39686390\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究主要开发基于下肢表面肌电的FOG预测系统，提供的是外周事件检测证据而非STN神经活动或FOG中枢机制证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:39693727\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接研究FOG相关的步态启动预期姿势调整（APA），发现踝背屈训练可同时改善APA和FOG，为区分中枢STN机制与外周运动准备及生物力学机制提供证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:39716169\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"荟萃分析报告rTMS能够改善PD患者FOG问卷评分，提供非STN皮层神经调控影响FOG的比较证据，有助于评估皮层-基底节网络机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:39732050\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究主要开发基于惯性传感器和模糊推理的PD一般步态评估模型，没有FOG特异性分析或STN神经活动数据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:39733649\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"荟萃分析提供非侵入性迷走神经刺激对PD患者FOG结局的直接证据，可用于比较脑干及其他非STN神经调控通路对FOG的影响。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "13a118d0-42a6-46e7-978e-cedfdeff279e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T160706418062Z", "elapsed_seconds": 251.391, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T16:11:17.827047+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "824fddf9ff9b3c68d64fee593545e1b69a15c38e77123214c5fc320ec8807896", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T160706418062Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "5d46d88fb1cf6e359d693f1298af6008570405a1775630a6cb1220a6b4e6c733"}}}
